<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Hanjin  Capetown - 140,000/10 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam 15/30 Sept $6.75 fio scale load/40,000 shinc Ankerkolen.</p>
<p>TBN - 130,000/10 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Rotterdam 15/30 August $6.45 fio scale load/25,000 shinc Novacoal.</p>
<p>ORE - TBN - 150,000/10 tonnes ore Port Hedland/Redcar and Immingham 25 Aug/5 Sept approx. $8.50 fio 1-2 BHP.</p>
</text>
